Package: backport-iwlwifi-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms, linux-headers-generic | linux-headers, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Intel WiFi driver backport (DKMS)
 This package provides the Intel WiFi driver backport as a DKMS module.
 The source and dkms.conf are installed to /usr/src/backport-iwlwifi-<version>/.
 The actual kernel module is built locally on install by DKMS for the running kernel.
